				\begin{document}$$\beta$$\end{document}β42 levels (in both MCI and CN) and a decrease in tau (only in MCI)20. Therefore, while prior research was unable to link the observed metabolic changes with AD pathology, it is likely that post-MMKD metabolic changes in CSF contribute to the observed reversal of AD-related pathological changes observed in this cohort.
